if NumberVariable variable="Dead" comparison_sign="=" value=0

> for each "Predators"
>> if NumberObjectVariable object="Predators" variable="HP" comparison_sign=">" value=0
>> if BuiltinCommonInstructions::CompareNumbers first_expression=expr(min(DistanceBetweenPositions(Predators.X(),Predators.Y(),Heyin.X(),Heyin.Y()),DistanceBetweenPositions(Predators.X(),Predators.Y(),Player3D.X(),Player3D.Y()))) comparison_sign="<" second_expression=650
>> do SetNumberVariable variable="HeyinDanger" modification_sign="=" value=1

@event
